# Build-context hygiene (V05 part 2): provisioning and operator secrets never
# enter any image build context, so no COPY instruction can bake them into a
# layer -- now or after a future Dockerfile change.
.env
.env.*
!.env.pilot.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
secrets/
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credential.json
**/agent_credentials.json
.git
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
artifacts/
